## Credential Env Vars

Credentials are **never** stored here — only the environment variable names.

| Persona | Env var (username) | Env var (password) | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| Admin | `QA_ADMIN_USER` | `QA_ADMIN_PASS` | Full system access |
| Standard User | `QA_USER_USER` | `QA_USER_PASS` | Regular end-user persona |
| Read-Only | `QA_READONLY_USER` | `QA_READONLY_PASS` | View-only permissions |

Add rows for each persona relevant to this project.

